      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'll double check the duplex settings and the physical cables tomorrow. one thing though, i was reading some old forum posts from a few years back about similar \"ghost\" jitter issues where nothing in the logs made sense, and someone mentioned \"gremlins\" in the hardware. i know that's just a joke, but with how random this is, do you think there are any specific types of intermittent hardware faults that behave that erratically?",
